8612975443_n.png", "id": "2190066554876971", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622162_2190066561543637_3274007273227385625_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cthu0Jnlj7UQ7kNvwHKpj4-&_nc_oc=Adp70NcP4dkChZEYUdLZS7ey6MKKxkBWKAsc-ApkYF86IEfd3rRCKcNizxXuS_VG4Ak&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSzhM_AN9LV0qaEea3YZF3UEciawmVGnZienUEKVjpyig&oe=6B030835"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "SimX VR - LTS", "keywords": [], "long_description": "SimX VR - LTS is the long-term support release of SimX VR. It receives critical fixes, with new features added on a slower schedule. If your institution hasn\u2019t asked you to use LTS, download the core SimX VR app to get the latest features.\n \nSimX is the first professional-grade wireless, multiplayer VR medical simulation. Physicians, nurses, and allied professionals can practice their skills on any virtual patient in any environment. Designed by physicians at Stanford and UCSF and already in use at top medical and nursing schools across the country, SimX is the most advanced VR medical training system.\n \nSimX VR and SimX VR - LTS are offered to business customers via paid subscriptions. Please contact us for details. ", "short_description": "SimX VR - LTS is the long-term support release of SimX VR. \n\nSimX is the first professional-grade wireless, multiplayer VR medical simulation. Physicians, nurses, and allied professionals can practice their skills on any virtual patient in any environment. Designed by physicians at Stanford and UCSF and already in use at top medical and nursing schools across the country, SimX is the most advanced VR medical training system."}]}, "developer_name": "SimX, Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.simxvr.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.simxvr.com/terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "SimX, Inc.", "suppor